  "body": "Set on approximately 667m² of freehold land, this substantial four-bedroom home plus office offers the space families are looking for, sought-after school zones and exciting potential to add value.\r\n\r\nComfortably liveable as is, the home would benefit from some modernising, but the underlying footprint is generous, with 2.5 bathrooms, two living areas and plenty of space to work with. Whether you're looking to move straight in and update over time or roll up your sleeves and add your own touches, there's plenty of opportunity here to make it your own and unlock its potential.\r\n\r\nTHINGS YOU'LL LOVE HERE:\r\n\r\n* 4 bedrooms + separate office\r\n* 2.5 bathrooms plus a separate toilet\r\n* 2 living areas + separate laundry\r\n* Approx. 667m2 freehold section\r\n* Dual zone for Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys & Westlake Girls\r\n* Sought-after Mairangi Bay coastal location with Village, shops and beach close by\r\n* Huge opportunity to modernise and add value\r\n* Explore future development potential, subject to Council approval and your own due diligence\r\n\r\n* For families, it's about securing space, land and highly sought-after school zones in one of the North Shore's popular coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\n* For DIYers and renovators, it's a chance to take a substantial home, modernise it, add value, and reap the rewards.\r\n\r\n* For developers, the 667m2 freehold landholding provides another avenue to explore its full potential.\r\n\r\nThe fundamentals are here: the location, the land, the size and the school zones. Now it's your turn to unlock the potential.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to move in, renovate, modernise or investigate the possibilities of the land, 55 Newhaven Terrace is a property worth putting on your radar.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself. Bring your imagination and discover the possibilities.\r\n\r\nAuction: Thursday 26 November at 5pm. Ray White, 135 Kitchener Road, Milford (unless sold prior).",
